cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use cTSEMO, cite this software release and the Bradford et al.
  TSEMO article listed under references.
title: cTSEMO
abstract: >-
  A sequential two-objective MATLAB extension of TSEMO for expensive
  optimization with one aggregate binary feasibility label per evaluation.
type: software
authors:
